  <p class=MsoNormal>Karbobala ke dasht me be aasra aale nabi</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Maare gaye ansaar sab, zakhmi hua ibne ali</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Munis nahi yawar nahi, ghaazi nahi akbar nahi</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Bikhre pade hai ja baja, laashe kahi aur sar kahi</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Matam karo ehle aza, ghar lut gaya shabbir ka</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Purse ko aai sayyeda, matam karo ehle aza</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Pursa bhare ghar ka hai ye, jo karbala me lut gaya</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Hussain<span style=mso-spacerun:yes>&nbsp; </span>ya hussain, hussain bekafan, hussain bekhata</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Sab milke azadaro zehra ko do pursa..(2)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Barbaad hua ran me ghar aale payambar ka</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Ek dopeher me lut gaya, maqdooma-e-alam ka ghar</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Kaunain ki shehzadiya, nauha kuna hai nange sar</p> 
